OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWoman faces hour-long drive to give
OL,4,Abirth as hospital suspends maternity
OL,5,Aservices
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer partner, Clinton McKeever, said the
OL,8,Fjourney from their home in Mullaghbawn
OL,9,Fcould take them up to 90 minutes in bad
OL,10,Fweather or heavy traffic.
OL,12,FThe Southern Health Trust apologised to
OL,13,Ffamilies facing longer journeys but
OL,14,Fsaid the shortage of obstetricians
OL,15,Fmeant services must be temporarily
OL,16,Fconcentrated at one hospital.
